{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "rationale": "REC-01 (SPANISH-ENGINE-ASSURANCE-01) WU-A coverage contract. Declares, per productive top-level type, the meaningful slices that must have machine-visible support plus a minimum distinct-case floor so a category cannot collapse to a single-example pseudo-grade, and the language/style slices the corpus as a whole must exhibit. Support counts every committed annotation (core + adversarial) because coverage measures corpus breadth; the gated precision/recall/FNR regression thresholds remain a separate authority in config.json and are not touched. The REC-01 WU-B corpus declares every required unit, so the coverage dimension is green; a type/slice/style that the corpus still exercises but this manifest no longer declares fails closed, so a required declaration cannot disappear silently.",
